    "summary": "The user asks the assistant for arguments in favor of mass transit and then pushes the assistant to take a stand on whether transit is \"objectively better\" than highway expansion. The assistant provides arguments for transit, attempts to bridge the gap with a \"hybrid approach,\" and finally acknowledges the necessity of roads for rural commerce and emergency services when directly challenged.",
